sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as main.cpp / run_eval.cpp
    participant HR as HarnessRunner
    participant ENV as Environment
    participant AL as AgentLoop
    participant EV as Evaluator (Keyword/Functional)
    participant TJ as Trajectory
    participant FS as File System (JSON export)

    Main->>HR: runBatch(tasks.json)
    HR->>HR: đọc danh sách task từ tasks.json

    loop với mỗi task trong tasks
        HR->>ENV: setup()
        ENV-->>HR: môi trường sẵn sàng

        HR->>AL: tạo AgentLoop mới, inject stepHook = HarnessRunner::onStep
        HR->>AL: run(task.instruction, task.max_steps)

        loop mỗi bước trong agent loop
            AL->>AL: think() / act() (như sequence diagram agent run)
            AL->>HR: stepHook(step)  %% Observer/Hook pattern
            HR->>TJ: steps.push_back(step)
        end

        AL-->>HR: trả kết quả cuối cùng
        HR->>ENV: teardown()

        HR->>EV: evaluate(trajectory, task)
        EV-->>HR: score / PASS-FAIL

        HR->>TJ: set success, total_tokens, total_time_ms
        HR->>FS: trajectory.toJson() -> trajectory_{task_id}.json
    end

    HR->>HR: tính success rate = pass / total
    HR-->>Main: vector<Trajectory> + success rate
